{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t國家主席習近平在深圳出席亞太經合組織工商領導人峰會開幕式，並發表主旨演講。<br/>\n<br/>\n他表示，中方願同各方攜手建設亞太共同體，促進亞太共同繁榮，亦支持成立世界灣區經濟合作聯盟，探索亞太經濟合作新路徑。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：王濱南\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T01:24:01.038209+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T12:01:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T02:17:40.015062+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T01:17:42.728693+00:00","content_hash":"54c0bc701afc95deb4f320eda738d022424d83ceb459d0251cc091c845443b1b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}